{"data":{"target":{"id":"ENSG00000106211","approvedSymbol":"HSPB1","functionDescriptions":["Small heat shock protein which functions as a molecular chaperone probably maintaining denatured proteins in a folding- competent state (PubMed:10383393, PubMed:20178975). Plays a role in stress resistance and actin organization (PubMed:19166925). Through its molecular chaperone activity may regulate numerous biological processes including the phosphorylation and the axonal transport of neurofilament proteins (PubMed:23728742). {ECO:0000269|PubMed:10383393, ECO:0000269|PubMed:19166925, ECO:0000269|PubMed:20178975, ECO:0000269|PubMed:23728742}."],"proteinIds":[{"id":"P04792","source":"uniprot_swissprot"},{"id":"A0A6Q8PF43","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A6Q8PFE7","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A6Q8PFK8","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A6Q8PGK1","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A6Q8PGY2","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A6Q8PH65","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A6Q8PHA6","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A6Q8PHJ6","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"C9J3N8","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"V9HW43","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"ENSP00000248553","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000405285","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000501628","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000501765","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000501831","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000502249","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000502461","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000502495","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000502510","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000502651","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000502714","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000772739","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000772740","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000802465","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"B2R4N8","source":"uniprot_obsolete"},{"id":"Q6FI47","source":"uniprot_obsolete"},{"id":"Q96C20","source":"uniprot_obsolete"},{"id":"Q96EI7","source":"uniprot_obsolete